Subject: [PATCH] 1816: the engagement push opens the conversation too; every
 push must carry its page

Board 1816: a tap on a notification should open the app on what it is
about. Audit of every sendPushNotification call: all carry a url except
the AI engagement push, which landed wherever the app defaults. It now
opens /chat. A new guard test scans the source and fails on any push
call without a url, so the gap cannot come back. No new words.

